{"pin":"BH00010","subcodes":[{"code":"BH00010","anchor":"","first_line":"Praise be unto Him Who is unique in His love and singular in His affection; verily, He is the Lord of all beings and the Sovereign of creation [3.5s]... ...The companions of God are, in this day, the lump that must leaven the peoples of the world. They must show forth such trustworthiness, such truthfulness and perseverance, such deeds and character that all mankind may profit by their example","first_line_orig":"الحمد للّه الذی تفرد بالمحبة و توحد بالوداد انه لمولی العباد و مالک الایجاد  ","language":"mixed","word_count":"13180","notes":" \u003ca href=\"https://d9263461.github.io/cl/Baha'i/Others/ROB/V4/Contents.html\"\u003eROB4.023?\u003c/a\u003e,  \u003ca href=\"http://web.archive.org/web/20070930181707/http://bahai-library.com/resources/leiden.list/leiden.list.html#112\"\u003eLL#112\u003c/a\u003e","translations":[{"language":"ar","lang_name":"Arabic"},{"language":"orig","lang_name":"Original"}],"refs":[{"kind":"manuscript","code":"BLIB_Or15713.144x","source":"BLIB_Or15713","locator":"144x"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA22:307","source":"INBA22","locator":"307","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v022/?page=155"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA28:049","source":"INBA28","locator":"049","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v028/?page=35"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA45:049","source":"INBA45","locator":"049","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v045/?page=51"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"Majlis210461.120x","source":"Majlis210461","locator":"120x","url":"http://bluefin.live/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/majlis_210461.pdf"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AKHA_129BE #18 p.ax","source":"AKHA_129BE #18 p.ax","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/akhbar-i-amri/"},{"kind":"publication","code":"ASAT5.263x","source":"ASAT5","locator":"263x","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/431.pdf#page=137"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AVK3.148.06x","source":"AVK3","locator":"148.06x","url":"http://r